000100*================================================================
000200* RDPIN  PROFESSIONAL INDEMNITY RISK DETAIL
000300*        THE 60-BYTE POL-RISK-DETAIL OF POLREC FOR LINE PIN.
000400*        USED BY RATPIN01.
000500*        policy-admin FILLS THE SAME 60 BYTES IN PRMCOMM
000600*        REQ-RISK-DETAIL WHEN IT CALLS PRMCALC0.
000700*
000800*  PROFESSION      A ACCOUNTANT, L LAWYER, M MANAGEMENT CONSULTANT
000900*  FEE-INCOME-K    FEE INCOME, THOUSANDS
001000*  YEARS-TRADING   YEARS IN BUSINESS
001100*  US-WORK         Y = ANY WORK FOR US CLIENTS
001200*  QUALIFIED       Y = CHARTERED / QUALIFIED
001300*================================================================
001400 01  WS-PIN-DETAIL.
001500     05  WS-PROFESSION            PIC X(01).
001600     05  WS-FEE-INCOME-K          PIC 9(07).
001700     05  WS-YEARS-TRADING         PIC 9(02).
001800     05  WS-US-WORK               PIC X(01).
001900     05  WS-QUALIFIED             PIC X(01).
002000     05  FILLER                  PIC X(48).
